result: 'Added group-by aggregates via chained method surface: store.group(keyField).agg(valField)
  with agg in {count,sum,avg,min,max}, returning Vec<Tuple([KeyTy,ValTy])> accessed
  as row[0]/row[1]. Implemented across AST/typer (try_store_group), HIR (StoreGroup
  + GroupAgg enum), MIR lowering, and a single-pass open-addressing hashtable codegen
  in store_ext/analytics.rs (emit_store_group) supporting int/string keys and int/float
  values. 6 new integration tests pass; full suite green with zero warnings.'
description: 'Item 5. Add ''group <field>'' query clause with aggregate exprs in select:
  select city, avg(age), count. Leverage runtime/column.c for @column stores. Tests
  for grouped aggregation results.'
